vate Powerful Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make diagonal matches through the center to activate your friends\u2019 skills.<br>Fill your SP gauge to unleash dramatic, visually striking special moves.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Treasures to Strengthen Your AI</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather cubes to obtain <strong>Treasure items</strong> that upgrade abilities and unlock special effects.<br>Customize your AI\u2019s playstyle and gain an edge in boss battles.</p>","developers":["One Team."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010030/9efe2f560bfa16a606936fff56ad2c53231dba96/header.jpg?t=1764483797","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3010030/303353019/7279c8fb181dbd15591af8a324072b3218793645/1758393274/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759167744","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3010030/303353019/7279c8fb181dbd15591af8a324072b3218793645/1758393274/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759167744","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3010030/303353019/7279c8fb181dbd15591af8a324072b3218793645/1758393274/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759167744","id":257202953,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257202953/231c09b1a34d143f65a40cf138e6c9f448ee4381/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759167744"}],"name":"BlockWorld Ai","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Sele